---
title:    "An Abstract Machine for Curry and its Concurrent Implementation in Java"
citation: "(Journal of Functional and Logic Programming, 1999)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/JFLP99.html"
date:     1999-03-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper describes an implementation of Curry in Java
where the concurrent and non-deterministic features of Curry are implemented with Java threads.